  "releaseNotes": "Security release. Contains a breaking change to the signed payload.\n\n- Malformed Authorization headers now return 401 instead of escaping as an unhandled exception,\n  and an unknown key ID is rejected identically to an invalid signature, removing a key-ID\n  enumeration oracle.\n- Inherits the whole-body content hash from Decos.Http.Signatures 2.0.0.\n  BREAKING: for bodies larger than 8192 bytes, signatures produced by 1.x do not validate against\n  2.x and vice versa. Signers and validators must be upgraded together.",
